- Total points balance (earned + balance, value in EUR via loyalty_points_per_euro setting)
- 5-star CSAT inline with ARIA radiogroup + i18n + silent-fail optimistic UI
- NEW backend: order_ratings table + OrderRating model + OrderRatingController
- POST /api/frontend/order/{id}/rating with auth:sanctum + throttle 10/1
- 7 PHPUnit tests: 1-5 valid, 0/-1/6/99 rejected 422, idempotent updateOrCreate, comment ≤500, branch isolation 404

A4 (M-1) — KioskSkeletonLoader greenfield component
