- Props validators + aria-busy + role=status + i18n aria-label
- @keyframes shimmer with prefers-reduced-motion respect
- Tokens-aware (var(--kiosk-surface-alt), --kiosk-border, --kiosk-radius-3)
- 10 vitest tests + docs/KIOSK_SKELETON_LOADER.md
- i18n key kiosk.skeleton.aria_label (avoid kiosk.loading collision)

A5 (M-4) — Payment security microcopy + 5 logos
